From 11cd0f95f138d57cc47a8844c2b8af16d2ca49aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Selman Trabzon <selman.trbzon@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:50:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] feat: one open link per play, shown only while playing

Foreseerr sends <scheme>://open?foreseerr=&ticket=&id= with a fresh
ticket on every play. The player switches to the ticket's user when it
is already signed in and pairs with Quick Connect otherwise, so nothing
about pairing has to be remembered on Foreseerr's side.

A run started by a link goes fullscreen and black at once instead of
showing the idle page, a link for a running player no longer raises its
window, and the idle page stays blank while a link is handled.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
